# Chu so huu: Q | Task: 9.2 | xem Task.md
#
# Ca hai may dev deu la Windows va `git config core.autocrlf` = true, tuc git **doi LF thanh
# CRLF luc checkout**. Voi file .md/.py thi vo hai, nhung:
#
#   docker-entrypoint.sh la thu container `api` chay dau tien, trong Linux.
#   CRLF o dong `#!/bin/sh` bien thanh `/bin/sh\r` -> container chet ngay voi
#   "exec /usr/local/bin/docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory",
#   mot thong bao khong he nhac gi toi ky tu xuong dong.
#
# Bay nay KHONG lo ra o may da viet file (file o do von la LF), chi lo ra o may **clone moi ve**
# - tuc dung luc nguoi thu hai thu chay du an. Vi vay ep LF cho moi script shell.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Cung ly do: Dockerfile va file cau hinh duoc doc trong container Linux.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
